ril "Agent Test Laws" version 3

law allow-safe-reads
  says "Agents may read safe files."
  why  "Read-only access to safe files is permitted."
  on action read of File
  permit when resource.safe == true

law deny-dangerous-writes
  says "Agents may never write to dangerous files."
  why  "Write access to dangerous files is forbidden."
  on action write of File
  forbid when resource.dangerous == true

law ask-sensitive-operations
  says "Agents must ask before accessing sensitive data."
  why  "Sensitive operations require human approval."
  on action access of Data
  ask when resource.sensitive == true
